Modifications made in retro-ipod-spotify-revival (2026), per Apache-2.0 section 4(b):
  - clickwheel/click.c: compile-time pin defines; busy loop replaced with pause()
    (approach from thehajime's pizero-2026 fork); signal handling; NO_HAPTIC option;
    UDP sent to loopback explicitly.
  - install/install.sh: DISPLAY_PROFILE (composite | st7789), composite as default;
    ARMv6 (Pi Zero W) support; go-librespot pinned to v0.10.4 with SHA256 verification
    instead of "latest"; rsync/file added to dependencies; pins passed to gcc.
  - install/bin/configure-display.sh (new): config.txt / cmdline.txt display setup,
    tested by tests/test_configure_display.sh.
  - install/bin/select-lcd-fb.sh: no-op when no fbdev config is installed (composite).
  - docs/spotify-callback.html: relay only forwards to *.local or private-IPv4 hosts.
  - install/config/config.env.example: redirect URI options.
  - tools/ui_preview.py, tests/, docs/guide/, docs/wiring/, .github/workflows/: new.
  - docs/README.md: GitHub Pages front page for this repository's login relay (replaces
    the upstream text); docs/_config.yml (new) keeps docs/upstream/ off the site.
  - frontend/requirements.txt: exact version pins; python-mpd2 added.
  - Music on iPod (2026): frontend/local_player.py and frontend/audio_router.py (new):
    MPD client and one-source-at-a-time switching; spotify_manager.py routes Now
    Playing, transport and volume through the active source; view_model.py adds the
    Music on iPod menus and Settings -> Update Music; install.sh, mpd.conf.template and
    spotifypod-mpd.service (new) install MPD behind LOCAL_MUSIC.
  - frontend/about.py (new), view_model.py: Settings -> About; install.sh writes
    /etc/spotifypod/install.env for it.
  - install/install.sh: comitup from comitup's own apt repository (COMITUP_SOURCE),
    apt-source package pinned by SHA256.
  - frontend/local_player.py: longer timeout for library calls (MPD_LIBRARY_TIMEOUT);
    long lists queue a 200-song window around the chosen song.
  - docs/spotify-callback.html, docs/README.md: relay stability notes.

